## Realtime Voting Rules
1. Always store and serve live counts from `poll_options.votes_count`.
2. Use Postgres triggers to keep `votes_count` in sync with `votes`.
3. Subscribe only to `poll_options` changes scoped by `poll_id`.
4. Never fetch all `votes` rows on results page; always use `votes_count`.
5. Keep subscriptions client-side and ensure cleanup on unmount.